  "html": "<p>歡迎 113 級新生加入 EMRD 溫暖的大家庭，願學長姐們在學習的旅途中不斷成長，並與同學和師長們一起探索新知識，獲取珍貴的友情與經歷，創造屬於您們的精彩故事。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/6a8ffc5324-06.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/a6cba3ec30-01.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 開學典禮合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;工程學院 陳明志院長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"533\" src=\"/legacy/img/2162f649ef-02.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"533\" src=\"/legacy/img/188ff5186e-03.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 游進陽執行長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 蔡孟霖副執行長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/7444a94369-04.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/cd41d7859e-05.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 113 級開學典禮&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 113 級開學典禮</p>",
